id: opportunist
name: Opportunist
talentCategory: teamwork
prerequisites: N/A
description: >
  You leap to the ready anytime an opportunity to injure an enemy presents itself.
text: >
  Opportunist: You leap to the ready anytime an opportunity to injure an enemy presents itself.
  –Prerequisites: N/A
  (1)-[Triggered, 1/Round]: If an Ally knocks an Opponent through a Health Threshold, you may use the Exploit Maneuver against that Opponent.
  (2)-[1/Encounter]: If you would use the Exploit Maneuver due to the first effect of this Trait, you may do so without spending a Counter Action.

---

# (1) An Ally knocking an Opponent through a Health Threshold (the `opponent-knocked` Moment): the Exploit at them, offered on
# your latest card - never Automatic, it hands over a Maneuver (chat.mjs opportunist).
[triggered/opponent-knocked, 1/round, outOfSequence, effect 1]
requires knockedByAlly && knockedOpponent;
opportunist();

# (2) That Exploit taken: asked whether without its Counter Action, once an Encounter (chat.mjs takeOutOfSequence).
